he small city of Karauli that has recently caught the attention of tourists is an exquisite home to well decorated havelis, peaceful shrines, picturesque views and imprinted chhatris that dot the entire city.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>THE 10 BEST Places to Visit in Karauli (2026) - Tripadvisor</title><link>https://www.tripadvisor.in/Attractions-g1162327-Activities-Karauli_Karauli_District_Rajasthan.html</link><description>Our guide took us to the Karauli 'market, but as he had heard there was a time-limited animal market we diverted to there first. This open area of barely earth had dozens of camels, and some horses and several groups of itinerant camped out in the space.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 23:45:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Karauli (करौली) - 20 Most Visited Places in Karauli - YouTube</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UnRJv1WjJxk</link><description>The Complete Karauli travel video &amp; 20 Best places to visit in Karauli | A Detailed Karauli Tourism video | Temples of Karauli | Forts of Karauli | Monsoon &amp; Waterfalls in Karauli |...</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:54:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Karauli: History, Geography, Places to See - Connect Civils</title><link>https://rajras.in/ras/pre/rajasthan/districts/karauli/</link><description>Karauli is famous for its geographical specialities and having full of natural beauty and covered by Vindhyanchal and Aravali mountains. In the Karauli tehsil hills become more high and extensive.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 03:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Karauli district - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karauli_district</link><description>Karauli district is a district of the state of Rajasthan in western India. karauli district is located in the Braj Bhoomi region. The town of Karauli serves as the administrative headquarters of the district.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 03:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Karauli (Princely State) Homepage with Pictures and Map : Rajput ...</title><link>https://rajputs.net/view/karauli</link><description>Maharaja Chandrapal, when Mahmud Khilji of Malwa attacked Karauli in 1454 and captured Karauli from Chandrapal, after that descendants of Maharaja Chandrapal again won Karauli during Badshah Akbar reign.</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 02:43:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>करौली - विकिपीडिया</title><link>https://hi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8C%E0%A4%B2%E0%A5%80</link><description>करौली की स्‍थापना 955 ई. के आसपास राजा विजय पाल ने की थी जिनके बारे में कहा जाता है कि वे भगवान कृष्‍ण के वंशज थे।एक समय जैसलमेर व करौली राज्यों पर यादव राज परिवारों का शासन रहा है। [1] 1818 में करौली ...</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 05:59:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Latest Karauli News (करौली न्यूज़): पढ़ें 26 सितम्बर के ताज़ा समाचार दैनिक ...</title><link>https://www.bhaskar.com/local/rajasthan/karauli/</link><description>Karauli News in Hindi (करौली समाचार): पढ़ें 26 सितम्बर शाम 4 बजे के ताज़ा समाचार, देश की न.1 न्यूज़ एप्प दैनिक भास्कर पर. Read 26 September 4PM Latest Karauli News @Dainik Bhaskar.</description><pubDate>Sat, 18 Apr 2026 20:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>करौली में घूमने की जगह। Places to visit in Karauli</title><link>https://ghumnekijagah.com/places/karauli/</link><description>करौली इतिहास प्रेमियों के लिए घूमने की एक अदभुद जगह है क्योंकि यह कई ऐतिहासिक आकर्षणों और मंदिरों से भरा हुआ है। करौली में लगभग 300 मंदिर स्थित है जो इसे एक लोकप्रिय धार्मिक स्थल बनाते हैं। यह ...</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:11:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>648      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:-- 20715\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
