er education system of the state, which includes universities, affiliated colleges and institutes. The Government of Rajasthan aims to build capacity, promote research and establish industry relationships for job opportunity to students.\n                   </p>\n                 </div>\n            </div>\n                </div>\n           </div>  <div    ><style>\r\n    .deptBuildingImg {\r\n        min-height: 200px;\r\n        max-height: 200px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n</style>\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"row\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n                <div class=\"card mb-4\">\r\n                    <img src=\"/website/DepartmentOfCollegeEducation/buildingimage/4d6474d3-e203-4eae-9638-cd908924700e.jpg\" class=\"card-img deptBuildingImg\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                                <h2>Department Of College Education</h2>\r\n                                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between border-top border-bottom\">\r\n                                    <label>Location :Block IV Dr S Radhakrishnan Shiksha Sankul Jawahar Lal Nehru Marg Jaipur 302015 </label>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <p>\r\n                                    Welcome to Department of College Education\r\n                                </p>\r\n                                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-end\">\r\n\r\n                                        <a href=\"10584\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-angle-double-right\"></i> Visit Site</a>\r\n               \r100 75547  100 75547    0     0  40114                                                         \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n     