r\n    }\r\n</style></div></div><div   class=\" container-fluid contentbox py-5\"  > <div    ><div class=\"col-md-12\"><h3 class=\"about-heading\"><strong>About Us</strong></h3></div><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"row\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"text-center\">Higher Technical Education: Government of Rajasthan</h3>\r\n        <h4>Vision</h4>\r\n        <p class=\"mb-5\">The Government of Rajasthan aims to improve the quality of higher education, encourage creative research and bring positive change in various fields of higher education.</p>\r\n        <h4>Objectives</h4>\r\n        <p class=\"mb-5\">Overseeing, monitoring, and regulating higher education programs in state colleges affiliated with various universities in benefit of students.</p>\r\n        <h4>Mission</h4>\r\n        <p class=\"mb-3\">The Government of Rajasthan strives to enhance and modernize the sector of higher education through the implementation of the following objectives:</p>\r\n\r\n        <ul class=\"ulListCommon\">\r\n            <li>Establishing rigorous standards for both undergraduate and postgraduate Higher education. </li>\r\n            <li>Encouraging innovative methods and fostering creativity in academic and entrepreneurial pursuits among students.</li>\r\n            <li>Advancing Higher Education in Educationally Backward Classes and Communities.</li>\r\n            <li>Providing quality Higher education aligned with new technologies and industrial requirements, thereby producing skilled technical manpower.</li>\r\n            <li>Promoting women empowerment, promoting social and economic development in backward communities, ensuring welfare of persons with disabilities and implementing minority welfare schemes.</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div></div></div>\n        \n        <div  class=\"6\" >\n            <div id=\"GridContainer_3\"></div>\n            <div   class=\" flat-row footer\"